    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The argument we are advancing in these blog posts is that when al-Tabari (d. 310/923) created his  Taʾrikh al-rusul wa-l-muluk, Jamiʿ al-bayan ʿan taʾwil ay al-Qurʾan (Tafsir)  and  Tahdhib al-athar , he relied on notes that were bound into notebooks of some kind, and we can reconstruct something of their contents.",
